				" cinematic luxury tennis fashion commercial, premium sporty summer aesthetic, elegant athletic energy, tropical tennis court atmosphere, glossy sunlight highlights, smooth camera movement, fashion editorial style, high-end commercial quality.\n\n[0s–2s]\nVertical 9:16 frame.\nThe camera begins low near the red tennis court surface. Tennis balls roll slowly past white sneakers and striped socks. Warm sunlight creates long cinematic shadows. The camera smoothly tilts upward along the girl’s legs and pink tennis dress as she rests the racket on her shoulder confidently.\n\n[2s–4s]\nMedium vertical tracking shot.\nShe casually adjusts her slim sunglasses while spinning the tennis racket in one hand. Her curls move softly in the breeze. The camera circles smoothly around her body as sunlight reflects across glossy skin, jewelry, and mirrored lenses.\n\n[4s–6s]\nSlow-motion action shot.\nShe swings the racket powerfully toward camera. The tennis ball flies past the lens with cinematic motion blur. Her pink dress and wristbands move dynamically while the tropical trees behind her blur beautifully with the motion.\n\n[6s–8s]\nThe camera follows closely beside her as she runs across the court. Sneakers slide slightly against the surface, kicking up tiny particles. Sunlight glows through her hair while her sunglasses reflect the tennis net and bright summer sky.\n\n[8s–10s]\nFinal hero shot in full vertical composition.\nShe stops confidently at center court holding the racket behind her shoulder. Multiple tennis balls bounce around her in slow motion while golden sunlight floods the frame. The camera slowly pulls backward revealing the entire luxury tropical tennis court atmosphere.\n\nLuxury sporty fashion campaign, cinematic summer lighting, elegant camera choreography, realistic cloth simulation, glossy beauty photography, premium tennis aesthetic, stylish athletic energy, fashion editorial quality.",
